  "dn24:1.11.2": "Spellings for Kaḷāramaṭṭaka vary greatly. ",
  "dn24:1.11.3": "In these practices we see some examples of the vows or observances (<i lang='pi' translate='no'>vata</i>) that Buddha rejected as “grasping at precepts and observances” ",
  "dn24:1.11.4": "A diet of pure meat is still undertaken today by certain would-be gurus. ",
  "dn24:1.11.5": "Compare the “vow of restraint in the directions” in the Jain Tattvārthasūtra 7.1. ",
