  "dn24:2.16.1": "",
  "dn24:2.16.2": "",
  "dn24:2.16.3": "Text has <i lang='pi' translate='no'>suññaṁ</i>, but this appears to be a mistake, since the mansion is no longer “empty” as Brahmā is already there. Follow <a href='https://suttacentral.net/dn1/en/sujato#2.4.3'>DN 1:2.4.3</a>, which lacks <i lang='pi' translate='no'>suññaṁ</i>. ",
